  "question": {
    "text": "A test particle is moving in a circular orbit in the gravitational field produced by a mass density <math><mi>&#961;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math> Identify the current relation between the radius <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> of the particle&rsquo;s orbit and its period <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>:</mo></math>"
  },
